[0.0, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[97mfinLM\u001b[0m \u001b[90m\u00b7\u001b[0m a governance layer for AI agents \u001b[90m\u00b7\u001b[0m \u001b[2mthe risk gate, under attack\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "  \u001b[90mReal gate, real MCP tool. The broker is a stand-in that records\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.1, "o", "  \u001b[90mwhatever reaches it - the demo is that its ledger stays empty.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.3, "o", "\r\n"]
[2.3, "o", "  \u001b[90mA human wrote this file. No code path in the package can create it.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
